  <region left="18" top="4955" width="500" height="88" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
    <content>
    <p bold="true">Problem 3: Adsorption Equilibrium Isotherm (Freundlich Power Law)</p>
    <p bold="true">Model Formulation: q_e = K_F * C_e^(1/n)</p>
    <p bold="true">Mapped to power-law form Y = a * X^b, where a = K_F [adsorption capacity] and b = 1/n [intensity].</p>
    <p bold="true">Fitted using the dedicated convenience function swarmfit_power.</p>
    </content>
  </text>
  </region>
  <region left="18" top="5055" width="132" height="117" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <math>
    <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
      <content>
        <p>Equilibrium solute concentration data vector C_e [mg/L]</p>
      </content>
    </description>
    <input>
    <e type="operand">Ce_data</e>
    <e type="operand">1.0</e>
    <e type="operand">2.5</e>
    <e type="operand">5.0</e>
    <e type="operand">10.0</e>
    <e type="operand">20.0</e>
    <e type="operand">40.0</e>
    <e type="operand">6</e>
    <e type="operand">1</e>
    <e type="function" args="8">mat</e>
    <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
    </input>
  </math>
  </region>
  <region left="18" top="5212" width="132" height="117" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <math>
