    <content>
    <p bold="true">=========================================================================</p>
    <p bold="true">SwarmFit Chemical &amp; Process Engineering Verification Summary:</p>
    <p bold="true">  1. Built-in Native Model (Michaelis-Menten Kinetics, &quot;mm&quot;): R2_mm &gt; 0.999 + visual fit plot</p>
    <p bold="true">  2. Built-in Exponential Relaxation (CSTR Tracer Washout, swarmfit_expdecay): R2_decay &gt; 0.999 + visual fit plot</p>
    <p bold="true">  3. Built-in Power Law Isotherm (Freundlich Adsorption, swarmfit_power): R2_power &gt; 0.998 + visual fit plot</p>
    <p bold="true">  4. User-Defined SMath Function (Haldane Substrate Inhibition, f_haldane): R2_haldane &gt; 0.998 + visual fit plot + '=' cached</p>
    <p bold="true">  5. User-Defined SMath Function (Langmuir Monolayer Adsorption, f_langmuir): R2_lang &gt; 0.998 + visual fit plot + '=' cached</p>
    <p bold="true">  6. User-Defined SMath Function (Consecutive Batch Kinetics A-&gt;B-&gt;C, f_consec): R2_consec &gt; 0.998 + visual fit plot + '=' cached</p>
    <p bold="true">  7. Fast Analytical Linear Baseline (Spectrophotometry, swarmfit_linear): R2_lin &gt; 0.999 + visual fit plot</p>
    <p bold="true">  8. Numerical diagnostics verified (SSE, RMSE, MaxResidual, Iterations, Improvements)</p>
    <p bold="true">  9. All variables carry descriptive engineering hover notes and tooltips</p>
    <p bold="true">=========================================================================</p>
